== Trivia ==
* Satan appeared in the Halloween Update for the original ''The Binding of Isaac.''
* Satan's pose as a statue and during the VS Screen is a nod to the demon [[Wikipedia:Baphomet|Baphomet]], who is usually portrayed in a similar pose.
* Satan, in mythology, began as a fallen angel but evolved over time into a greater evil. This may be the reason The Fallen spawns at the start of the fight.
* The demonic speech Satan shouts at the start of his first phase reuses one of Mom's voice lines, shouting "Isaac!" in reverse with heavy distortion.
* The music that plays during this battle is titled ''[https://ridiculon.bandcamp.com/track/hericide-satan-fight Hericide]''. He​ricide is a combination of the latin word ''herus'' (or ''erus''), meaning master or lord, and the suffix -''cide'', denoting the act of killing.
** This music also plays during the battle against {{e|Mega Satan}}.
** {{dlc|a}} This music also plays during the nightmare wave of [[Greed Mode]], for unlocking the floor's [[Devil Room]] or [[Angel Room]].

